Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:20.85,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,I have already lost everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:30.69,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Now I just wander with no destination
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:37.13,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,But when I close my eyes, it comes back to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:46.41,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,The promise I exchanged, with you on that day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:56.12,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,I can fly again, into the endless sky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:01:01.12,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,It shines just as brightly today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:11.00,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Because back then, I believed only in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:40.73,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Now all alone, I clasp my hands together
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:45.70,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Let me offer a prayer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:52.47,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,To this world that has become terribly stained
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:02:01.32,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Those days we spent running hand in hand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:06.25,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,No matter how fierce the storm becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.25,0:02:18.00,Nanum Barun Gothic,,0,0,0,,Please don't forget to find your courage.
